battle_companies.json: companies[0].reinforcements.rows[0]: a row is either "nothing" or a "unit", not both
battle_companies.json: companies[0].reinforcements.rows[1]: a row needs a "unit", "nothing": true, "special": true, "choose" or "options"
battle_companies.json: companies[0].reinforcements.rows[2].blocks: blocks belongs to a "nothing" row
battle_companies.json: companies[0].reinforcements.rows[3].rare: rare belongs to a row with a unit
